msgid "Split strokes."
msgstr "暂不合并最近笔画数"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/undo_history.rst:1
msgid "Overview of the undo history docker."
msgstr "介绍 Krita 的撤销历史面板。"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/undo_history.rst:12
msgid "Undo"
msgstr "撤销"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/undo_history.rst:12
msgid "Redo"
msgstr "重做"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/undo_history.rst:12
msgid "History"
msgstr "历史"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/undo_history.rst:17
msgid "Undo History"
msgstr "撤销历史"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/undo_history.rst:20
msgid ".. image:: images/dockers/Krita_Undo_History_Docker.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/dockers/Krita_Undo_History_Docker.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/undo_history.rst:21
msgid ""
"This docker allows you to quickly shift between undo states, and even go "
"back in time far more quickly than rapidly reusing the :kbd:`Ctrl + Z` "
"shortcut."
msgstr ""
"你可以在此面板中查看并快速切换到某次撤销操作，无需抓瞎狂按 :kbd:`Ctrl + Z` 快"
"捷键。"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/undo_history.rst:23
msgid "Cumulate Undo"
msgstr "合并撤销"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/undo_history.rst:26
msgid "Cumulative Undo"
msgstr "合并撤销"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/undo_history.rst:28
msgid ""
"Click on the settings icon at the bottom of the Undo History docker. It will "
"show you a dialog box to enable cumulative undo. You can change these "
"parameters:"
msgstr ""
"撤销历史面板底部有一个按钮，点击后可以在对话框中启用合并撤销功能。你可以更改"
"下列设置："

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/undo_history.rst:30
msgid "Start merging time"
msgstr "合并开始时间"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/undo_history.rst:31
msgid ""
"The amount of seconds required to consider a group of strokes to be worth "
"one undo step."
msgstr "上次合并结束 - 下次合并开始之间的最小间隔秒数。"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/undo_history.rst:32
msgid "Group time"
msgstr "同组最长间隔"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/undo_history.rst:33
msgid ""
"According to this parameter -- groups are made. Every stroke is put into the "
"same group until two consecutive strokes have a time gap of more than T "
"seconds. Then a new group is started."
msgstr "上一笔和下一笔间隔多少秒才被视作不同撤销分组。"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/undo_history.rst:35
msgid ""
"A user may want to keep the ability of Undoing/Redoing his/her last N "
"strokes. Once N is crossed -- the earlier strokes are merged into the "
"group's first stroke."
msgstr ""
"一般来说，画师总是希望能逐笔撤销最近绘制的几个笔画。此选项可以让最近绘制的笔"
"画超过设定的笔数后，才把之前的几个笔画合并为一组。"
